{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:8.05.110","page_type":"section"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","content_hash":"8a798eac8131e7fb37b423f04885c8546c7837473bbfd3183ee6cb5166abf752","heading":"Intermediary service.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","text":"(a) Persons owning or leasing an automatic dialing device may have the device interconnected to a telephone line transmitting directly to:\n(1) A central station;\n(2) A modified central station; or\n(3) A licensed answering service.\n(b) Relaying of messages by intermediate services to the Police Department shall be over a special trunk line, except that central stations may relay messages over a direct line. All telephone charges involved shall be paid by such intermediate services or central stations.\n(c) Automatic dialing devices may be interconnected to one or more telephone numbers available to the owner or lessee of the devices, or their designated representative, at another location.\n(d) This section shall apply only to those automatic dialing devices interconnected to the communications center in the Police Department, other municipal offices or to telephone company operators. (Code 1981 § 34-143. Code 1995 § 62-112.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"b9234b0b-5aa9-54e5-9c92-eda4d9de7fe3"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","content_hash":"6778100739f1cbd452dd45601b0f454275c8194395835cf36ad69cf8133f5059","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","text":"(a) Persons owning or leasing an automatic dialing device may have the device interconnected to a telephone line transmitting directly to:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e2d6b3a1-18fc-50b0-bc67-f7573053401d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","content_hash":"843e9672563e2311ade6995b6cd0e716ec3b024f7ed3cc2422b4a99097c8a3d8","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","text":"(1) A central station;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e84db5de-3ea8-544f-b618-1af9fceeffe8"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","content_hash":"15ac3ade2b56c5ab8b0f837158b40213d9eb9c9415a37950df180e6928f1406c","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","text":"(2) A modified central station; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"966c29c9-937c-59e8-9dfb-f9827c89d302"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","content_hash":"d21f9312a81646b6f0614ca40616e719d5f5623619014dd9535f9b8c0d979b9e","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","text":"(3) A licensed answering service.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1af5be68-c6e7-501c-a0c0-c42edf5db722"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","content_hash":"bbc8e40df75c5b2f7ebb04fa33e693824f11fb3b281f286cbf65a085a717fdd2","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","text":"(b) Relaying of messages by intermediate services to the Police Department shall be over a special trunk line, except that central stations may relay messages over a direct line. All telephone charges involved shall be paid by such intermediate services or central stations.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"df2bc675-3e8a-563a-8866-3983b0a8158e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","content_hash":"8c049447bca84062e911214217001db837b1d082c4347105f5ff1f83fc1935fb","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.110:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110","text":"(c) Automatic dialing devices may be interconnected to one or more telephone numbers available to the owner or lessee of the devices, or their designated representative, at another location.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3fc3834f-305e-56a7-8cca-a3c0096e2afc"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"8.05.110","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/8.05.110